{"version":1,"content":"<p>澳洲東南部維多利亞省周一（19日）發生懷疑針對國會議員的蓄意襲擊事件。</p><p>65歲無黨籍聯邦眾議員海恩斯（Helen Haines），在其位於旺加拉塔（Wangaratta）的選區辦事處外遭一輛汽車撞擊，傷勢危殆，43歲司機當場被捕。</p><p>總理阿爾巴尼斯形容事件看似是蓄意襲擊。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T10:20:01.922993+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T09:53:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T14:57:44.109475+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T10:17:34.434089+00:00","content_hash":"3ba50945755d7fa94c4fd44831c28f24b75bdb6ea141789755a3b988a4073d8f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}